(
F5 T4 U4: control_mesh_delete_geometry without _projection_type deletes the filled circle {manual 6.166: elements in the total inner area of the circle radius plus its tolerance; the GNU behaviour before the record}.
A 4x4 quad4 mesh on 0..4 x 0..4; geometry_circle 7 centre 2 2, radius 1.45, tolerance 0.05: the nodes 1,1 3,1 1,3 3,3 lie on its edge within the tolerance, elements 6, 7, 10 and 11 lie inside it.
Elements 6, 7, 10, 11 are deleted. The Professional 02-08-2026 deletes none {it tests the circle edge only and ignores the record; class D DELETE-PROJECTION-TYPE, owner decision C123}.
)
